   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Get an agent to think about the solution without looking at\nthe code or 'what we want'. The idea is that the agent\nthinks by itself and is not biased by what we have because\n'is already done'",
